00:21:04,587 --> 00:21:06,827
- Which school did you go to?
- Korea Science Academy of KAIST.

506
00:21:07,327 --> 00:21:08,327
Which of them is more prestigious?

507
00:21:08,857 --> 00:21:10,497
Hey,
I only asked because I knew the answer.

508
00:21:11,667 --> 00:21:13,267
He's just trying to intimidate me.

509
00:21:19,807 --> 00:21:21,437
Just because of what we did yesterday,

510
00:21:21,437 --> 00:21:24,147
I feel like
there's a line between us and them now.

511
00:21:24,147 --> 00:21:25,877
Imagine how weird this feels for me.

512
00:21:25,877 --> 00:21:28,377
We were allied with those teams.

513
00:21:28,377 --> 00:21:30,917
- The three teams had fun together.
- Exactly.

514
00:21:30,917 --> 00:21:32,817
The atmosphere is exactly the opposite
of yesterday's.

515
00:21:32,817 --> 00:21:34,887
Right after that heist thing,

516
00:21:34,887 --> 00:21:36,857
we started calling them jerks.

517
00:21:36,857 --> 00:21:39,857
That's when the atmosphere changed.
It feels strange now.

518
00:21:39,857 --> 00:21:41,357
There's a strange tension in the air.

519
00:21:42,397 --> 00:21:44,197
The look in their eyes is different now.

520
00:21:46,127 --> 00:21:47,267
I caught a bit of their plan.

521
00:21:47,267 --> 00:21:49,037
- It looks like Ji Hoo will...
- Right?

522
00:21:49,037 --> 00:21:50,097
- do all the heavy lifting.
- That team...

523
00:21:50,097 --> 00:21:51,607
- He'll do all the work by himself.
- There's no way we can lose.

524
00:21:51,607 --> 00:21:52,837
Yes, it'll be like a one-man game.

525
00:21:52,837 --> 00:21:55,007
Why would he volunteer
to be a one-man army?

526
00:21:55,007 --> 00:21:56,807
Well, this is how I see it.

527
00:21:56,807 --> 00:21:58,807
They think that this game only requires
mathematical ability.

528
00:21:58,807 --> 00:22:00,177
And since Ji Hoo will be the one
to build the combos,

529
00:22:00,177 --> 00:22:01,177
they're just letting him do everything.

530
00:22:01,177 --> 00:22:02,817
But you can't play this game alone.

531
00:22:02,817 --> 00:22:04,787
This is the most difficult game
among all the games I've played.

532
00:22:04,787 --> 00:22:05,787
But that's a good thing for us.

533
00:22:05,787 --> 00:22:07,117
Just like Jin Hyeong did
in the second season,

534
00:22:07,387 --> 00:22:09,787
- he'll be shouting 1.42 million.
- Exactly, he'll make the same mistake.

535
00:22:09,787 --> 00:22:11,557
My guess is that he'll shout 2.14 million.

536
00:22:11,787 --> 00:22:12,987
- Let's double up.
- I bet he'll make the same mistake.

537
00:22:12,987 --> 00:22:13,997
Let's double up.

538
00:22:13,997 --> 00:22:16,627
That rookie is bound to
make a huge mistake.

539
00:22:16,627 --> 00:22:17,997
- It's practically a tradition.
- Right.

540
00:22:17,997 --> 00:22:19,327
I wonder what kind of mistake he'll make.

541
00:22:20,537 --> 00:22:22,697
Everyone makes mistakes and grows
at his age.

542
00:22:25,007 --> 00:22:28,177
How many people will you need
to help you calculate?

543
00:22:28,707 --> 00:22:29,707
I don't need any help.

544
00:22:29,707 --> 00:22:31,407
- You prefer to work alone, right?
- Yes.

545
00:22:31,707 --> 00:22:33,777
- Then we'll focus on finding tiles.
- Okay.

546
00:22:33,777 --> 00:22:35,317
Just give us simple tasks,
like fetching water for you.

547
00:22:35,317 --> 00:22:37,017
- Okay.
- Feel free to give us such tasks.

548
00:22:37,587 --> 00:22:38,847
- Okay.
- You can give all members such tasks.

549
00:22:39,447 --> 00:22:40,457
You're the king of our team.

550
00:22:40,787 --> 00:22:41,787
Oh, yes!

551
00:22:43,317 --> 00:22:45,157
If we can just do a good job
at finding tiles,

552
00:22:45,457 --> 00:22:47,097
we'll have a very good chance to win.

553
00:22:47,097 --> 00:22:48,497
- That's a fact.
- Our computer seems...

554
00:22:48,497 --> 00:22:50,497
- more state-of-the-art than theirs.
- There's no way we can lose.

555
00:22:50,497 --> 00:22:52,627
We have a more state-of-the-art computer
with better hardware.

556
00:22:52,627 --> 00:22:53,627
While Ji Hoo is like an active pro,

557
00:22:53,627 --> 00:22:55,697
the members of that team are like
retired veterans.

558
00:23:00,737 --> 00:23:02,477
We're going to win
an overwhelming victory today.

559
00:23:02,477 --> 00:23:04,377
That's right.
Let's show them what we've got.

560
00:23:05,647 --> 00:23:07,117
Those punks.

561
00:23:09,047 --> 00:23:11,187
We have a solid strategy.

562
00:23:11,187 --> 00:23:12,647
And the good thing about that is...

563
00:23:12,647 --> 00:23:14,617
that in Round 5,
we can build some extra combos...

564
00:23:14,617 --> 00:23:16,987
- using the tiles they discard.
- Yes, that's right.

565
00:23:16,987 --> 00:23:18,127
But we can't let them find out,

566
00:23:18,127 --> 00:23:20,087
so those who don't play the game must
guard our area.

567
00:23:20,087 --> 00:23:22,657
- Many of them can be really sly.
- Like Kim Kyoung Hoon.

568
00:23:22,657 --> 00:23:24,927
- Poke them in the eye if they come here.
- I've got them covered.

569
00:23:25,227 --> 00:23:27,397
As long as we keep our strategy secured,
we'll definitely win.

570
00:23:27,397 --> 00:23:29,937
Also, Ji Hoo planned the entire strategy
for his team all by himself.

571
00:23:29,937 --> 00:23:31,967
And his strategy is to calculate well.

572
00:23:31,967 --> 00:23:34,477
So there's no way we can lose.
Try to remain calm at all times.

573
00:23:34,477 --> 00:23:35,937
When you're searching for tiles...

574
00:23:35,937 --> 00:23:36,937
Quiet down.

575
00:23:37,377 --> 00:23:38,977
Every tile can be useful,

576
00:23:38,977 --> 00:23:40,547
so search thoroughly
to find as many tiles as possible.

577
00:23:41,417 --> 00:23:43,817
The preparatory meeting session is over.

578
00:23:44,647 --> 00:23:45,987
(Outdoor, Round 1: Jeong Keun Woo,
Lee Tae Gyun, 2: Xitsuh, Heo Seong Beom,)

579
00:23:45,987 --> 00:23:47,287
(3: Hong Jin Ho, Park Ji Min,
4: Jeong Keun Woo, Lee Sang Min)

580
00:23:47,287 --> 00:23:48,587
(Team Indoor Alliance,
Round 1, 3: Kwak Beom, Shin Seung Yong,)

581
00:23:48,587 --> 00:23:49,857
(Round 2, 4: Kwak Beom, Hyun Sung Joo)

582
00:23:50,057 --> 00:23:53,057
Kwak Beom and Shin Seung Yong
from the Team Indoor Alliance...

583
00:23:53,687 --> 00:23:56,657
and Jeong Keun Woo and Lee Tae Gyun
from the Team Outdoor Alliance...

584
00:23:56,797 --> 00:23:59,097
