- Let's do a chant together.

585
00:23:59,097 --> 00:24:00,197
- Let's go!
- Gather around, everyone.

586
00:24:00,197 --> 00:24:01,997
All right. We'll lift our hands up, okay?

587
00:24:01,997 --> 00:24:03,267
- Up.
- One, two, three.

588
00:24:03,267 --> 00:24:04,437
- Let's do this!
- Let's do this!

589
00:24:04,767 --> 00:24:06,467
- Let's do a chant too.
- Let's do that.

590
00:24:06,467 --> 00:24:08,107
- One, two, three. Let's do this!
- Let's do this!

591
00:24:08,107 --> 00:24:09,107
Don't copy us.

592
00:24:10,077 --> 00:24:12,277
Round One will now begin.

593
00:24:12,277 --> 00:24:18,947
(Equation Combo, Round 1,
Remaining tiles: 175)

594
00:24:23,357 --> 00:24:24,657
- Hey, we might get hurt.
- Hey, be careful!

595
00:24:24,657 --> 00:24:26,327
Don't push him!

596
00:24:26,327 --> 00:24:28,227
Are they doing the ambush thing or what?

597
00:24:29,397 --> 00:24:31,697
(Keun Woo runs quickly
and takes the lead.)

598
00:24:42,237 --> 00:24:44,947
I didn't really want to
dive into the swimming pool.

599
00:24:46,107 --> 00:24:49,047
But since multiplication tiles are
very crucial,

600
00:24:49,117 --> 00:24:52,587
I figured they must be hidden somewhere
that's hard to find.

601
00:24:55,987 --> 00:24:59,657
I had no choice but to dive into the pool
the moment the round began.

602
00:25:00,257 --> 00:25:03,297
We figured useful tiles must be hidden
in tricky places.

603
00:25:03,297 --> 00:25:05,767
I told Seung Yong
to dive into the swimming pool. Why?

604
00:25:05,767 --> 00:25:07,337
Because he has beautiful chest muscles.

605
00:25:11,107 --> 00:25:12,537
His body must feel heavy now.

606
00:25:12,537 --> 00:25:15,177
In my opinion, that's a wrong strategy.

607
00:25:15,937 --> 00:25:17,277
You shouldn't go into the water.

608
00:25:26,787 --> 00:25:28,687
Before the game began, I saw Seung Yong...

609
00:25:28,687 --> 00:25:30,217
- change into his swimming suit.
- I'll take off my pants.

610
00:25:31,157 --> 00:25:33,857
I bet he didn't watch "Bloody Game 3."

611
00:25:34,027 --> 00:25:37,057
Being completely soaked in water
makes it hard to move your body around.

612
00:25:37,057 --> 00:25:40,567
And the pool is in the opposite direction
of all the other spots.

613
00:25:43,797 --> 00:25:46,767
(Team R's room)

614
00:25:48,707 --> 00:25:50,307
Darn it. Where is it?

615
00:25:59,287 --> 00:26:01,557
(Team P2's room)

616
00:26:02,017 --> 00:26:06,157
Here's the basic strategy
for finding tiles in this game.

617
00:26:06,157 --> 00:26:08,357
You must search the places
that the others wouldn't.

618
00:26:09,027 --> 00:26:13,327
That way, you can quickly find the tiles
hidden right in plain sight.

619
00:26:13,997 --> 00:26:17,467
(Tae Gyun begins his search
in each team's room.)

620
00:26:17,467 --> 00:26:18,837
(Team P3's room)

621
00:26:18,837 --> 00:26:22,307
Keun Woo and I split the places to search.

622
00:26:22,907 --> 00:26:25,907
(Keun Woo ran toward the main hall
on the 1st basement floor right away.)

623
00:26:26,447 --> 00:26:28,647
My goal was to sweep the main hall clean.

624
00:26:57,107 --> 00:26:59,277
There it is. Oh, gosh.

625
00:26:59,577 --> 00:27:00,577
Okay.

626
00:27:04,917 --> 00:27:06,387
I've found all of the tiles
that were hidden in here.

627
00:27:06,947 --> 00:27:10,627
I found 15 or 16 tiles in the main hall,
as far as I know.

628
00:27:10,627 --> 00:27:12,027
I found a lot of tiles.

629
00:27:12,027 --> 00:27:13,857
I think
I almost swept the main hall clean.

630
00:27:14,397 --> 00:27:18,797
(Jeong Keun Woo's next searching target
is the outdoor area.)

631
00:27:19,527 --> 00:27:24,137
(Outdoor search zone, rooftop, main hall)

632
00:27:24,667 --> 00:27:27,677
(I'll make sure
to sweep the outdoor zone clean too.)

633
00:27:29,007 --> 00:27:31,447
(Kwak Beom is already searching
the outside.)

634
00:27:35,047 --> 00:27:36,377
I headed far out,

635
00:27:37,147 --> 00:27:39,247
