the multiplication and division tiles.

660
00:29:32,067 --> 00:29:33,227
I've been looking at these numbers
all along.

661
00:29:33,227 --> 00:29:34,237
(Xitsuh has been given a mission.)

662
00:29:34,237 --> 00:29:35,637
- We have to use fewer than ten tiles.
- Ten tiles...

663
00:29:35,737 --> 00:29:37,937
Since I didn't play in the first round,

664
00:29:37,937 --> 00:29:40,637
