669
00:30:00,327 --> 00:30:02,097
What are you doing, Hye Seon?

670
00:30:04,527 --> 00:30:05,667
That was so smooth.

671
00:30:05,667 --> 00:30:07,267
I can calculate that much, you know.

672
00:30:07,367 --> 00:30:08,537
It was quite smooth.

673
00:30:12,807 --> 00:30:14,807
I looked at what he wrote,
with no intention of hiding it.

674
00:30:15,907 --> 00:30:18,247
Ji Hoo wrote down some equations...

675
00:30:18,247 --> 00:30:20,477
