1713
01:18:55,007 --> 01:18:56,017
I'll go down.

1714
01:18:57,217 --> 01:18:58,377
Yes.

1715
01:18:58,377 --> 01:18:59,817
Yes, carry them.

1716
01:19:00,317 --> 01:19:02,157
