3129
02:23:20,337 --> 02:23:22,337
Kim Nam Hee,
please reveal your card combination.

3130
02:23:22,337 --> 02:23:25,307
(Team C's Kim Nam Hee's
card combination gets revealed.)

3131
02:23:25,707 --> 02:23:28,717
Kim Nam Hee's total is 18.

3132
02:23:30,117 --> 02:23:32,687
There's still a possibility...

3133
02:23:32,687 --> 02:23:34,317
