3137
02:23:42,797 --> 02:23:44,627
(Team R wins Round 1
if Shin Seung Yong is over 15.)

3138
02:23:44,627 --> 02:23:46,437
Shin Seung Yong,
please reveal your card combination.

3139
02:23:48,537 --> 02:23:49,807
