Please return one Life.

3143
02:24:02,817 --> 02:24:05,347
(Shin Seung Yong returns 1 life.)

3144
02:24:05,347 --> 02:24:07,817
Kim You Hyun, as you rang the bell,

3145
02:24:07,817 --> 02:24:09,957
