3214
02:26:35,097 --> 02:26:37,807
Since our lips are red,
our lips will be for red.

3215
02:26:38,107 --> 02:26:40,977
Our skin is yellow,
so this will be for yellow.

3216
02:26:41,177 --> 02:26:42,377
As for green,

3217
02:26:42,877 --> 02:26:45,247
