02:48:12,497 --> 02:48:13,767
(Hyun Sung Joo: 18)

3718
02:48:13,767 --> 02:48:14,837
But Sung Joo...

3719
02:48:14,837 --> 02:48:17,197
(Hyun Sung Joo: 18)

3720
02:48:17,197 --> 02:48:18,807
said the two of us...

3721
02:48:19,067 --> 02:48:21,377
had over 15 in the 1st turn.

3722
02:48:21,637 --> 02:48:23,737
It's Kwak Beom's turn.

3723
02:48:23,737 --> 02:48:24,847
(He rings the bell right away.)

3724
02:48:24,847 --> 02:48:25,907
I rang the bell right away.

3725
02:48:25,907 --> 02:48:27,647
(Front card, Kang Ji Hoo, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Kwak Beom)

3726
02:48:27,647 --> 02:48:29,147
Unbelievable. Are you serious?

3727
02:48:29,377 --> 02:48:30,377
- Really?
- Are you being serious?

3728
02:48:30,377 --> 02:48:32,117
- Kwak Beom rang the bell.
- Are you being silly or what?

3729
02:48:32,787 --> 02:48:34,387
- I rang the bell.
- You're being serious?

3730
02:48:34,717 --> 02:48:36,287
The other players will switch cards...

3731
02:48:36,287 --> 02:48:37,727
- in order.
- This is crazy.

3732
02:48:37,727 --> 02:48:39,557
- My hands are shaking.
- The previous round made him mad.

3733
02:48:39,557 --> 02:48:40,827
- It's Kang Ji Hoo's turn.
- Are you being serious?

3734
02:48:40,827 --> 02:48:42,657
This isn't a skit?

3735
02:48:42,857 --> 02:48:43,897
Oh, my gosh.

3736
02:48:43,897 --> 02:48:44,927
I'll take card six in red.

3737
02:48:44,927 --> 02:48:47,097
Card six in red has been selected.

3738
02:48:47,367 --> 02:48:49,237
(Kang Ji Hoo: 6)

3739
02:48:49,237 --> 02:48:51,637
Card two in red has been discarded.

3740
02:48:52,037 --> 02:48:54,477
- It's Kim Kyoung Hoon's turn.
- He doesn't get to switch, right?

3741
02:48:54,577 --> 02:48:56,737
- I have to reveal my cards.
- Right. You have to reveal your cards.

3742
02:48:56,737 --> 02:48:58,307
- I'm the last one to switch, right?
- Yes.

3743
02:48:58,747 --> 02:49:00,377
- Gosh.
- It's over once I reveal my cards.

3744
02:49:00,377 --> 02:49:03,077
(Kim Kyoung Hoon: 8)

3745
02:49:03,077 --> 02:49:04,217
(Sighing)

3746
02:49:04,217 --> 02:49:06,747
- Why hide your happy face?
- No. Things are bad for me.

3747
02:49:07,217 --> 02:49:08,417
I'll take a card from the pile.

3748
02:49:08,417 --> 02:49:10,217
The back card has been selected.

3749
02:49:10,217 --> 02:49:11,987
(Kim Kyoung Hoon: 8)

3750
02:49:11,987 --> 02:49:13,687
Please.

3751
02:49:14,727 --> 02:49:15,797
Please!

3752
02:49:15,797 --> 02:49:16,827
(Groaning)

3753
02:49:20,367 --> 02:49:22,267
Kwak Beom,
please reveal your card combination.

3754
02:49:22,267 --> 02:49:23,497
Let's take Ji Hoo's Life.

3755
02:49:24,667 --> 02:49:25,667
It's 16.

3756
02:49:25,667 --> 02:49:27,677
Kwak Beom's total is 16.

3757
02:49:27,937 --> 02:49:30,137
Kang Ji Hoo,
please reveal your card combination.

3758
02:49:30,807 --> 02:49:31,977
Was this a bad move?

3759
02:49:33,307 --> 02:49:34,517
(Kang Ji Hoo: 19)

3760
02:49:34,517 --> 02:49:35,617
- Gosh!
- Okay.

3761
02:49:35,847 --> 02:49:38,617
- It's over.
- Kang Ji Hoo's total is 19.

3762
02:49:38,747 --> 02:49:41,557
- It was originally that.
- Hyun Sung Joo's total is 18.

3763
02:49:41,957 --> 02:49:44,127
Kim Kyoung Hoon,
please reveal your card combination.

3764
02:49:44,127 --> 02:49:45,457
(What is Kim Kyoung Hoon's
card combination?)

3765
02:49:45,457 --> 02:49:46,827
Anything can happen.

3766
02:49:48,057 --> 02:49:50,297
"Am I going to make a legendary scene
in a card game?"

3767
02:49:54,667 --> 02:49:56,337
- Gosh!
- How did it come to this?

3768
02:49:56,497 --> 02:49:57,637
- How did it come to this?
- Kim Kyoung Hoon's total...

3769
02:49:57,637 --> 02:49:59,567
- is 17.
- I got it at the very last moment.

3770
02:49:59,567 --> 02:50:00,837
These were my cards at the start.

3771
02:50:00,837 --> 02:50:02,577
- Are you serious?
- I had 1, 1, and 7.

3772
02:50:02,577 --> 02:50:03,807
- You just got this card?
- Yes.

3773
02:50:04,107 --> 02:50:05,707
- I thought I was doomed.
- Gosh.

3774
02:50:05,807 --> 02:50:09,377
Kyoung Hoon got a miracle card
at the very end.

3775
02:50:09,817 --> 02:50:11,787
How did that appear at that moment?

3776
02:50:12,087 --> 02:50:14,017
- I was about to go crazy.
- Kwak Beom's total...

3777
02:50:14,017 --> 02:50:16,917
- is the lowest. Please return one Life.
- Gosh.

3778
02:50:17,117 --> 02:50:18,857
- That was a good game.
- I was about to die.

3779
02:50:18,987 --> 02:50:21,197
- Gosh.
- Gosh.

3780
02:50:21,597 --> 02:50:22,857
(Team C wins Round 2.)

3781
02:50:22,857 --> 02:50:24,027
I felt so scared.

3782
02:50:25,267 --> 02:50:28,937
A god of Ring the Bell
would've made the same move,

3783
02:50:29,497 --> 02:50:30,737
so I don't regret my decision.

3784
02:50:30,937 --> 02:50:32,567
We got incredibly unlucky.

3785
02:50:32,567 --> 02:50:33,837
You'll know once you play,

3786
02:50:33,967 --> 02:50:36,807
but it's really hard once you lose
a few Lives.

3787
02:50:37,207 --> 02:50:39,407
It's a relief that we managed
to do well in the end.

3788
02:50:40,107 --> 02:50:43,217
It does seem like they came up
with a more detailed plan.

3789
02:50:44,287 --> 02:50:46,517
- But...
- No. We were just unlucky.

3790
02:50:46,517 --> 02:50:48,687
- Right. We were really unlucky.
- We both made over 20.

3791
02:50:48,687 --> 02:50:50,487
It doesn't make sense that we lost
with just one life left.

3792
02:50:50,487 --> 02:50:52,627
- Right.
- We were really unlucky.

3793
02:50:53,127 --> 02:50:54,627
Another thing that I learned...

3794
02:50:54,957 --> 02:50:57,867
was that the one to ring the bell
lost twice as more Lives.

3795
02:50:57,967 --> 02:50:59,727
That must be thought of more.

3796
02:51:00,027 --> 02:51:02,597
I thought that the game should be played
in a safer approach.

3797
02:51:02,597 --> 02:51:04,337
"Let's not be hasty with the bell."

3798
02:51:04,537 --> 02:51:05,567
We did well.

3799
02:51:05,767 --> 02:51:07,107
Do you want to play another round?

3800
02:51:07,267 --> 02:51:10,237
No. You two won together.

3801
02:51:10,537 --> 02:51:14,217
It's right for this combination to go
as it worked earlier.

3802
02:51:14,377 --> 02:51:15,747
I wanted to play,

3803
02:51:15,747 --> 02:51:18,647
but the two of them brought us a win.

3804
02:51:19,247 --> 02:51:21,017
I lost with Sung Joo.

3805
02:51:21,657 --> 02:51:23,517
It felt right to make the two
who won a round to go again.

3806
02:51:25,557 --> 02:51:29,297
Team C's Player 3,
please move to the 3rd spot.

3807
02:51:29,297 --> 02:51:30,857
(The players of Round 3 enter.)

3808
02:51:30,857 --> 02:51:32,167
You did well.

3809
02:51:32,167 --> 02:51:34,167
- It's not Ji Hoo?
- It's me, you punk.

3810
02:51:34,337 --> 02:51:35,597
(Surprised)

3811
02:51:35,597 --> 02:51:36,837
It was to complicate things.

3812
02:51:37,537 --> 02:51:39,207
Ji Hoo said he lost his head.

3813
02:51:39,537 --> 02:51:41,107
He said he couldn't play again.

3814
02:51:41,107 --> 02:51:43,237
He told me to send Kyoung Hoon
as he was a good player.

3815
02:51:43,537 --> 02:51:45,707
You Hyun, I think it will be better
for you to go out with Kyoung Hoon.

3816
02:51:45,807 --> 02:51:47,107
- Why is that?
- I lost my head right now.

3817
02:51:47,347 --> 02:51:48,477
- You? Why is that?
- Yes.

3818
02:51:48,777 --> 02:51:49,777
It was tough for me.

3819
02:51:49,777 --> 02:51:51,017
The time limit of one minute
felt too short.

3820
02:51:52,087 --> 02:51:54,287
I was struggling a lot mentally.

3821
02:51:54,517 --> 02:51:57,517
I thought I would definitely cause
a big mistake if I played another round.

3822
02:51:58,187 --> 02:51:59,387
That was the decision I came up with.

3823
02:51:59,387 --> 02:52:01,527
We will begin Round Three.

3824
02:52:01,697 --> 02:52:04,197
I will start dealing the cards
starting with Hyun Sung Joo.

3825
02:52:04,527 --> 02:52:05,567
I'm serious.

3826
02:52:07,367 --> 02:52:09,597
I'm serious.

3827
02:52:11,767 --> 02:52:14,037
(Seung Yong sends a signal.)

3828
02:52:14,307 --> 02:52:16,877
It's Hyun Sung Joo's turn.

3829
02:52:16,877 --> 02:52:18,377
Please return to your places.

3830
02:52:19,247 --> 02:52:20,707
- Gosh.
- Gosh.

3831
02:52:20,707 --> 02:52:22,947
Hyun Sung Joo rang the bell.

3832
02:52:23,147 --> 02:52:26,247
The other players will switch cards
in order.

3833
02:52:27,287 --> 02:52:29,057
It's Kim Kyoung Hoon's turn.

3834
02:52:29,057 --> 02:52:31,957
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3835
02:52:32,327 --> 02:52:33,587
What color do you need?

3836
02:52:33,827 --> 02:52:34,827
- Me?
- Yes.

3837
02:52:34,827 --> 02:52:35,957
- I need green.
- What?

3838
02:52:35,957 --> 02:52:37,027
Green.

3839
02:52:37,027 --> 02:52:38,297
- Really?
- Yes.

3840
02:52:38,297 --> 02:52:42,297
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3841
02:52:42,297 --> 02:52:43,367
Sure. I'll give it to you.

3842
02:52:44,467 --> 02:52:46,707
Card four in green has been discarded.

3843
02:52:47,007 --> 02:52:48,737
It's Shin Seung Yong's turn.

3844
02:52:48,737 --> 02:52:50,737
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3845
02:52:54,617 --> 02:52:55,677
I'll take the random card.

3846
02:52:55,877 --> 02:52:57,917
- The back card has been selected.
- Darn it.

3847
02:52:58,047 --> 02:52:59,617
I wouldn't have been able to play
a green card.

3848
02:52:59,717 --> 02:53:00,717
That was amazing.

3849
02:53:01,117 --> 02:53:02,587
- That was amazing.
- I felt so nervous.

3850
02:53:02,587 --> 02:53:03,817
I wouldn't have been able to play that.

3851
02:53:03,817 --> 02:53:05,187
(Shin Seung Yong)

3852
02:53:05,187 --> 02:53:06,187
Red!

3853
02:53:07,487 --> 02:53:09,757
Card five in blue has been discarded.

3854
02:53:09,757 --> 02:53:11,727
It's Kim You Hyun's turn.

3855
02:53:11,727 --> 02:53:12,967
I'll take the card from the pile.

3856
02:53:12,967 --> 02:53:14,897
The back card has been selected.

3857
02:53:15,397 --> 02:53:17,437
Hyun Sung Joo,
please reveal your card combination.

3858
02:53:17,867 --> 02:53:19,407
- What is it?
- This is higher.

3859
02:53:19,407 --> 02:53:20,407
(Hyun Sung Joo reveals
his card combination first.)

3860
02:53:20,907 --> 02:53:23,407
- Hyun Sung Joo's total is 18.
- Gosh, it's high.

3861
02:53:23,407 --> 02:53:25,607
Kim Kyoung Hoon,
please reveal your card combination.

3862
02:53:25,607 --> 02:53:26,607
(Kim Kyoung Hoon reveals
his card combination.)

3863
02:53:27,207 --> 02:53:29,677
Kim Kyoung Hoon's total is 15.

3864
02:53:30,377 --> 02:53:32,747
Shin Seung Yong,
please reveal your card combination.

3865
02:53:33,787 --> 02:53:36,387
(Shin Seung Yong: 15)

3866
02:53:36,387 --> 02:53:38,227
(Shin Seung Yong: 25)

3867
02:53:38,227 --> 02:53:39,387
- Gosh!
- Gosh!

3868
02:53:39,387 --> 02:53:41,857
- Shin Seung Yong's total is 25.
- It was really green for him?

3869
02:53:41,857 --> 02:53:44,157
- The total is 11.
- But why didn't you take it earlier?

3870
02:53:44,157 --> 02:53:45,197
It was a mistake.

3871
02:53:46,397 --> 02:53:49,337
It can never be a mistake.

3872
02:53:49,937 --> 02:53:53,367
He was trying to get into my mind.

3873
02:53:53,367 --> 02:53:55,677
I realized Seung Yong wasn't someone
to mess about with.

3874
02:53:56,937 --> 02:53:59,077
Kim You Hyun's total is 11.

3875
02:53:59,647 --> 02:54:02,217
Kim You Hyun's total is the lowest.

3876
02:54:02,217 --> 02:54:03,917
Please return one Life.

3877
02:54:04,887 --> 02:54:06,347
Gosh, right from the start,

3878
02:54:07,147 --> 02:54:08,487
you got a great hand.

3879
02:54:08,987 --> 02:54:10,157
Well,

3880
02:54:10,517 --> 02:54:11,857
nothing could've been done about that.

3881
02:54:12,157 --> 02:54:14,657
I will start dealing the cards
starting with Hyun Sung Joo.

3882
02:54:21,737 --> 02:54:23,337
(Sung Joo sends a signal.)

3883
02:54:23,337 --> 02:54:24,667
(Hyun Sung Joo: 15)

3884
02:54:24,667 --> 02:54:27,307
It's Hyun Sung Joo's turn.

3885
02:54:27,407 --> 02:54:29,507
It feels great when you get
two cards of different colors...

3886
02:54:29,507 --> 02:54:30,737
that are high in number.

3887
02:54:30,737 --> 02:54:32,947
From the upcoming turns,
getting any red card...

3888
02:54:32,947 --> 02:54:33,947
will be nice.

3889
02:54:33,947 --> 02:54:35,417
It can turn out to be a greater number.

3890
02:54:35,647 --> 02:54:37,417
In the midst of all that,
the almost best card...

3891
02:54:37,417 --> 02:54:39,517
of ten in green was drawn.

3892
02:54:40,347 --> 02:54:41,617
I'll take the front card.

3893
02:54:42,017 --> 02:54:44,257
Card ten in green was selected.

3894
02:54:44,257 --> 02:54:48,027
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3895
02:54:48,027 --> 02:54:49,697
If it's ten,

3896
02:54:49,997 --> 02:54:51,397
the minimum is 15...

3897
02:54:51,797 --> 02:54:52,967
and the maximum is 20.

3898
02:54:52,967 --> 02:54:55,637
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3899
02:54:56,967 --> 02:54:58,907
- Card five in green has been discarded.
- Gosh.

3900
02:54:58,907 --> 02:55:00,507
You discarded a green card?

3901
02:55:00,507 --> 02:55:01,507
Hey, he has 20.

3902
02:55:01,507 --> 02:55:02,977
It's Kim Kyoung Hoon's turn.

3903
02:55:02,977 --> 02:55:04,847
- Kyoung Hoon, discarding five in green...
- Right.

3904
02:55:04,847 --> 02:55:06,577
- means he definitely has 20.
- Right.

3905
02:55:07,007 --> 02:55:08,317
I'll take the random card.

3906
02:55:08,317 --> 02:55:10,247
The back card has been selected.

3907
02:55:10,247 --> 02:55:11,687
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3908
02:55:16,057 --> 02:55:18,427
Card two in red has been discarded.

3909
02:55:18,857 --> 02:55:20,457
It's Shin Seung Yong's turn.

3910
02:55:20,457 --> 02:55:21,657
I'll take the random card.

3911
02:55:21,657 --> 02:55:23,727
The back card has been selected.

3912
02:55:23,727 --> 02:55:26,897
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3913
02:55:31,407 --> 02:55:33,807
Card four in red has been discarded.

3914
02:55:34,007 --> 02:55:35,077
(Shin Seung Yong sends a signal.)

3915
02:55:35,077 --> 02:55:36,737
It's Kim You Hyun's turn.

3916
02:55:37,477 --> 02:55:40,377
Seung Yong touched his ear
in the first turn.

3917
02:55:44,077 --> 02:55:46,787
Card eight in red has been discarded.

3918
02:55:47,147 --> 02:55:48,917
It's Hyun Sung Joo's turn.

3919
02:55:48,917 --> 02:55:52,127
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3920
02:55:52,227 --> 02:55:53,987
(Hyun Sung Joo)

3921
02:55:54,287 --> 02:55:56,457
Hyun Sung Joo rang the bell.

3922
02:55:56,457 --> 02:55:57,757
He has 20.

3923
02:55:57,757 --> 02:56:00,997
The other players will switch cards
in order.

3924
02:56:01,437 --> 02:56:02,437
A random card.

3925
02:56:02,437 --> 02:56:05,167
Kim Kyoung Hoon has selected
the back card.

3926
02:56:06,567 --> 02:56:08,177
I'll take the card from the pile.

3927
02:56:08,177 --> 02:56:09,977
The back card has been selected.

3928
02:56:09,977 --> 02:56:12,677
(Front card, Kim You Hyun, Hyun Sung Joo,
Kim Kyoung Hoon, Shin Seung Yong)

3929
02:56:12,677 --> 02:56:14,147
I'll take the card from the pile.

3930
02:56:14,147 --> 02:56:16,017
The back card has been selected.

3931
02:56:17,817 --> 02:56:20,087
Hyun Sung Joo,
please reveal your card combination.

3932
02:56:22,517 --> 02:56:23,957
(Hyun Sung Joo: 20)

3933
02:56:23,957 --> 02:56:26,387
- Hyun Sung Joo's total is 20.
- I'll go.

3934
02:56:26,387 --> 02:56:28,957
Kim Kyoung Hoon,
please reveal your card combination.

3935
02:56:29,157 --> 02:56:30,727
The highest one.

3936
02:56:32,467 --> 02:56:34,767
Kim Kyoung Hoon's total is nine.

3937
02:56:35,067 --> 02:56:36,767
- That was the highest number possible?
- Yes.

3938
02:56:36,767 --> 02:56:39,067
Shin Seung Yong,
please reveal your card combination.

3939
02:56:39,307 --> 02:56:41,237
(Shin Seung Yong: 15)

3940
02:56:41,237 --> 02:56:43,807
Shin Seung Yong's total is 15.

3941
02:56:44,477 --> 02:56:46,747
Kim You Hyun,
please reveal your card combination.

3942
02:56:47,207 --> 02:56:49,777
Sung Joo rang the bell
as soon as the second set began.

3943
02:56:49,877 --> 02:56:51,717
My hand wasn't that bad,

3944
02:56:51,717 --> 02:56:55,087
but Sung Joo and Seung Yong's hands
were really good.

3945
02:56:55,087 --> 02:56:57,357
Kyoung Hoon's hand was really bad.

3946
02:56:59,357 --> 02:57:01,697
Kim You Hyun's total is two.

3947
02:57:01,897 --> 02:57:04,197
- I...
- Kim You Hyun's total is the lowest.

3948
02:57:04,197 --> 02:57:06,427
- Okay.
- Please return one Life.

3949
02:57:06,427 --> 02:57:07,427
There's a rule...

3950
02:57:07,597 --> 02:57:10,737
where the one who rings the bell
has to return two Lives.

3951
02:57:10,737 --> 02:57:13,667
One person should keep all of the Lives,

3952
02:57:13,667 --> 02:57:15,637
and the other person should keep one Life.

3953
02:57:15,637 --> 02:57:17,907
